{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 0, "model_name": "stockmark/stockmark-2-100b-instruct", "content": "To Japan's shores thou dost intend to stray,\nAn itinerary thus I'll weave for thee a day.\n\nUpon arrival, Nipon's capital, Tokio, doth greet thy sight,\nThou shalt survey the skyward reaching tower of Tokyo Skytree,\nWhere city sprawls beneath thy feet.\n\nNext, Kyoto's ancient streets await thy presence,\nTemples, where time's embrace is felt,\nGardens, where flowers do sing in silent eloquence,\nOf days long past and beauty's tender dance.\n\nVenture to Nara's vast plain,\nWhere deer roam free,\nSouls of nature's grace,\nBeneath the watchful eye of Todai-ji's might.\n\nHakone's mountain air,\nSpa's healing waters,\nMount Fuji's majesty,\nSilhouetted against the sky's own artistry.\n\nWithdraw to the coast,\nAmami Oshima's sands,\nOcean's vastness,\nNature's playground, where spirits are free.\n\nReturn to Tokyo,\nSavor flavors unique,\nHarajuku's trends,\nShibuya's vibrant pulse,\nNightlife's enchanting hues.\n\nThus endeth the journey, a tapestry woven,\nOf cultures, landscapes, memories,\nJapan's embrace, forever thine.", "logprobs": [{"token": "To", "logprob": -2.3676772117614746}, {"token": " Japan", "logprob": -1.1837437152862549}, {"token": "'s", "logprob": -2.3724210262298584}, {"token": " shores", "logprob": -0.862849235534668}, {"token": " thou", "logprob": -0.9084230065345764}, {"token": " d", "logprob": -1.0978057384490967}, {"token": "ost", "logprob": -0.08414045721292496}, {"token": " intend", "logprob": -1.7226157188415527}, {"token": " to", "logprob": -0.07990485429763794}, {"token": " stray", "logprob": -2.547233819961548}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.04196479544043541}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.5386155247688293}, {"token": "An", "logprob": -4.940542221069336}, {"token": " itiner", "logprob": -0.23313245177268982}, {"token": "ary", "logprob": -0.0008453133050352335}, {"token": " thus", "logprob": -3.4749808311462402},